@startuml
title Follow-Up Reminder Workflow

state "Awaiting Qualifying Action" as AwaitingQualifyingAction
state "Within Follow-Up Expectation" as WithinFollowUpExpectation
state "Requires Attention" as RequiresAttention
state "Reminder Requested" as ReminderRequested
state "Reminder Sent" as ReminderSent
state "Follow-Up Completed" as FollowUpCompleted
state "Reminder Suppressed" as ReminderSuppressed

[*] --> AwaitingQualifyingAction : CandidateSuppliedOrStageRequiresAction
AwaitingQualifyingAction --> WithinFollowUpExpectation : FollowUpClockStarted
WithinFollowUpExpectation --> RequiresAttention : FollowUpThresholdPassed
WithinFollowUpExpectation --> FollowUpCompleted : QualifyingOutcomeLogged

RequiresAttention --> ReminderRequested : ReminderPolicyEvaluated
RequiresAttention --> FollowUpCompleted : QualifyingOutcomeLogged
ReminderRequested --> ReminderSent : NotificationDelivered
ReminderRequested --> ReminderSuppressed : SuppressionRuleApplied
ReminderSent --> FollowUpCompleted : QualifyingOutcomeLogged
ReminderSent --> ReminderSuppressed : CadenceLimitReached
ReminderSuppressed --> RequiresAttention : SuppressionWindowExpired

FollowUpCompleted --> [*]

note right of ReminderRequested
Notification delivery must go through the
Notification Framework and record a timeline activity.
end note

note bottom
TODO: Confirm start, pause, reset, stop, working-hours,
threshold, cadence, channel, recipient, and escalation rules.
end note

@enduml
